WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.920
Welcome to Train. Develop. Serve. Lead.. I’m Brian

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.960
Kennedy Jr. Your goal is a weekly practice

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.920
and review plan. Choose one manageable practice for

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.760
this week and write when you will review

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:14.400
it. Keep your work private, record what you

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:17.520
tried, and set a review date. Participation and

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:21.280
reflection are not guarantees of personal transformation; faith

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:22.560
reflection is optional.
